### Create Store
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/stores
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "storeCode": "VAN-001",
  "name": "SmartMart Fraser",
  "city": "Vancouver",
  "province": "BC",
  "address": "123 Fraser Street"
}

### Get All Stores
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/stores

### Get Store By ID
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/stores/1

### Update Store
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/stores/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "storeCode": "VAN-001",
  "name": "SmartMart Fraser Updated",
  "city": "Vancouver",
  "province": "BC",
  "address": "456 Fraser Street"
}

### Deactivate Store
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/v1/stores/1/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "active": true
}